### Test API - Library Management System
### Dung Thunder Client hoac REST Client extension de chay

### 1. Test health check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### 2. Dang ky tai khoan reader
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reader@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van Reader",
  "phone": "0912345678"
}

### 3. Dang ky tai khoan librarian (sau nay phai update role trong database)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "librarian@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van Librarian",
  "phone": "0912345679"
}

### 4. Dang ky tai khoan admin (sau nay phai update role trong database)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van Admin",
  "phone": "0912345680"
}

### 5. Dang nhap bang tai khoan reader
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reader@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 6. Xem profile (thay <TOKEN> bang token nhan duoc o buoc 5)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 7. Test endpoint reader (reader co the truy cap)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/test/reader
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 8. Test endpoint librarian (reader KHONG the truy cap - se bi loi 403)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/test/librarian
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 9. Test endpoint admin (reader KHONG the truy cap - se bi loi 403)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/test/admin
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
